# Player death architecture (pointer)

Full law: [`docs/docs/architecture/player-death.md`](../../docs/docs/architecture/player-death.md).

**Permanent decision:** character dies on HP ≤ 0 or lethal medication toxicity
([Player](../../docs/docs/architecture/player.md)). Respawn: valid **custom
respawn** if set, else **home-world Hab**
([Home Worlds](../../docs/docs/architecture/home-worlds.md)). On wake: full HP,
toxicity 0, hunger/thirst safe baseline. Cell owns death + resolve; no default
ghost mode; no client free-teleport. Ship hull destroy ≠ automatic character
death.

When changing death, respawn precedence, or post-death vitals reset, read the
full doc first. Also listed in `AGENTS.md`.
